{"3888010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "白噪", "steam_appid": 3888010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rock Superstar: White Noise!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guess who's back? The guardian of the cosmos, humanity's greatest hero—<strong>White Noise</strong>! Armed with earth-shattering beats and unstoppable power, he's returning to the battlefield to save the world in the wildest way imaginable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888010/extras/4b8cc9e508619f46e2fbbdc0dfd2a13a.avif?t=1764653085\" width=800 height=449 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is the Power of the Beat!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >White Noise draws his strength from music! Every move, every attack—when synced to the rhythm—unleashes devastating force. Dodging bullets? Easy. Powering up weapons? No problem. The tougher the enemy, the harder the beat drops. In this chaotic symphony of battle, <i>you</i> are the conductor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888010/extras/e230233a887a12e1d81c1887f4dcf4bf.avif?t=1764653085\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crush Your Enemies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >White Noise's arsenal is as untamed as his rock show—shotguns, power punches, missiles, and cinematic finishers worthy of a hero’s entrance! From space cowboys to cosmic zombies, he has a hundred ways to make them regret ever crossing him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888010/extras/6374cbecfd51c9a886772ec267c83fc5.avif?t=1764653085\" width=800