ower punches, missiles, and cinematic finishers worthy of a hero’s entrance! From space cowboys to cosmic zombies, he has a hundred ways to make them regret ever crossing him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888010/extras/6374cbecfd51c9a886772ec267c83fc5.avif?t=1764653085\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ahead Lies the Sea of Stars!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for an epic superhero rock opera? Grab your headphones, crank up the volume, and let White Noise take you on a rhythm-shooting rampage like nothing you've ever experienced before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888010/extras/0c3214c2ee667a7bd7c52ec8ad01f886.avif?t=1764653085\" width=800 height=417 /></span></p>", "short_description": "What?! Mr. Boring is trying to invade the universe? No way! Grab your shotgun, power gauntlets, rocket launcher, and the 24/7 rock ‘n’ roll bass cannon! Unleash a storm of bullets to the beat of the sickest rhythm and save the world the only way a true superhero can, White Noise!", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888010/bc9e594ca53a02b8afe618601f712c3e7c0f8389/header.jpg?t=1764653085", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888010/5b453032ed8653541b8cd8f580537e26382ae234/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764653085", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888010/5b453032ed8653541b8cd8f580537e26382ae234/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764653085", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><s